This is the MongoDB Version of this Homework

I have two python files:
load_mongo.py: this loads up the data to MongoDB
main_mongo.py: this execute the program and shows the following:
	Repeat patrons
	Total renewals
	Most active patron

Python packages to install: pymongo

For MongoDB:
Created an Atlas Account
In Database Access, create username and password
In Network Access, add current IP Address
Copy connection string from: Connect > Drivers > Python, and replace username and password with your own


To run this program:
To set up connection string, using PyCharm for both python files: Run > Edit Configuration > Environment Variables, and here you add “MONGO_URI=” and add connection string to this.
Run load_mongo.py once: loads up data
Run main_mongo.py for results
